@page "/Home/Contact"

<PageTitle>Contact Us</PageTitle>

<div class="contact-page">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>

    <p>We would love to hear your comments, questions, and suggestions about the International Fairy-Tale Filmography.</p>

    <p>
        Because this site is published as a static application, feedback and technical questions are collected through the
        project issue tracker. Please do not include personal or sensitive information in an issue.
    </p>

    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/International-Fairy-Tale-Filmography/frontend/issues/new/choose" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Submit website feedback</a>
        <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="https://github.com/International-Fairy-Tale-Filmography/data/issues/new/choose" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Suggest a film or data correction</a>
    </div>
</div>